<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ashton sells Helix stake.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ashton sells Helix stake.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diamond miner Ashton Mining Ltd said on Thursday it has sold 5.97 million shares in gold explorer Helix Resources NL which represents its entire stake and is about 12.89 percent of Helix's issued capital.</p>
<p>Ashton said the trade was done through J.B. Were &amp; Son.</p>
<p>Brokers said the parcel was sold at A$4.45 per share.</p>
<p>At 2.15 p.m. (0315 GMT), Helix shares were 20 cents up at A$4.55 with 6.32 million shares traded.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
